    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d355">

                <pb facs="0511" n="423" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg423"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Strobel to Mr.
                            Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-01-18"><hi rendition="#italic">January 18, 1889</hi></date>.
                        (Received February 2.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 388.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the Department’s No. 6 of the
                    17th ultimo, to Mr. Belmont, I have the honor to inclose a copy of a note which
                    I have addressed to the minister of state in reference to the retention by the
                    governor of Ponape of title deeds to land in that island belonging to the
                    American missionary, Mr. Doane.</p>
                <p>I have, etc,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edward H. Strobel</hi>.<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires ad interim.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d355-a1.xml" xpointer="d355-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
